  "description": "The IpgKit citizen account surface — register, sign in, password reset, email confirmation, two-factor and profile — together with the Customer identity stack and the separate \"Citizen\" cookie scheme it runs on. Optional: reference it only if you want the kit's own citizen accounts. A consumer that already has a citizen identity system takes IpgKit.Web.Pay alone and brings its own. Consume via AddIpgKitCustomer / UseIpgKitCustomer.",
